:29:22.330Z","archetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"月在幽冥，光自不息；大道之行，常隐于喧嚣之外。世人逐明而失真，惟在孤寂中可有所感。是夜风高月白，思古今之志士，多困而不屈。人生苦短,兼济独善，天道可知乎 \n大道隐幽暗，对月夜凭栏。知音今古何在，歌尽渺尘寰。眉敛千庭皓月，目送秋江万点，无语向\u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"like_count":5,"views":24,"category_id":1,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":3,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"原始发帖人","user":{"id":1,"username":"PalmPoetry","name":null,"avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/palmpoetry/{size}/7_2.png","admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":4}},{"extras":null,"description":"最近的发帖人","user":{"id":3,"username":"海边2026","name":"Vivian Huang","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/海边2026/{size}/20_2.png","trust_level":1}},{"extras":"latest","description":"最新发帖人","user":{"id":4,"username":"Qinghongh","name":"user387","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/qinghongh/{size}/22_2.png","trust_level":1}}]},{"fancy_title":"米沃什：礼物","id":16,"title":"米沃什：礼物","slug":"topic","posts_count":2,"reply_count":0,"highest_post_number":2,"image_url":"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/flex009/uploads/palmpoetry/optimized/1X/61f63c481491f8f10cfdd8c6899a2de980e84cd5_2_768x1024.jpeg","created_at":"2026-08-20T00:12:29.081Z","last_posted_at":"2026-08-20T11:08:58.123Z","bumped":true,"bumped_at":"2026-08-20T11:08:58.123Z","archetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"多么快乐的一天。 \n雾早就散了，我在花园里干活。 \n蜂鸟停在忍冬花的上面。 \n尘世中没有什么我想占有。 \n我知道没有人值得我去妒忌。 \n无论我遭受了怎样的不幸， \n我都已忘记。 \n想到我曾是同样的人并不使我窘迫 \n我的身体里没有疼痛。 \u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"like_count":1,"views":10,"category_id":1,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":1,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"原始发帖人","user":{"id":3,"username":"海边2026","name":"Vivian Huang","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/海边2026/{size}/20_2.png","trust_level"